  "managementDiscussion": "In fiscal year FY2026, Bharti Airtel recorded revenue of \u20b92.30 lakh crore, growing 15.0% year-on-year, driven by continued momentum across Mobile Services, Airtel Digital. Net income stood at \u20b90.35 lakh crore with a net margin of 15.0% and a return on equity of 18.0%. Operating cash flow remained robust at \u20b90.83 lakh crore, supporting capital expenditure of \u20b90.28 lakh crore and a free cash flow of \u20b90.55 lakh crore. The company maintains a measured capital structure with net debt-to-equity of 1.89x. Management continues to invest in digital and AI capabilities, expects sustained volume-led growth and disciplined cost control, and remains committed to value-accretive capital allocation and sustainable returns for shareholders.",
